## Exploring

Rarely. Only when the desk cannot settle a question *and* the answer would
change your decision — is the "existing pattern" a delta invokes really
there; is the "impossible" case reachable. One or two explorers a gate at
most; a gate that needs more is a gate whose documents need revising.
